      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1035",
      "reading_order": 1117,
      "section": "7.2.11 MINIPOLE ASSEMBLY REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 108.0,
        "t": 695.1027600000001,
        "r": 540.0408960000009,
        "b": 650.2079130491803
      },
      "content": "The minipole assembly attaches to the infuser through two holes in the heatsink and is held in place by a cotter ring. This cotter ring passes through a hole near the end of the longer of the two vertical rods on the bag hanger and prevents the removal of the minipole assembly from the holes in the pole clamp (see Figure 7-10) ."
    },
